ing by land and by sea  4,000 soldiers and Army Corps engineers  have already arrived in the US Virgin  Islands and Puerto Rico and the Navy is  sending their floating Hospital to  comfort which should arrive next week  gale can't get there too soon thank you  very much Omar Villafranca reporting  from San Juan
 

